# ── Root ignore for the whole monorepo ─────────────────────────────────────────
# `custom_ecommerce_build/` and `mobile/` carry their own .gitignore files as
# well; this one covers what neither of them can see.

# Dependencies — including packages/core's scoped install, which has no ignore
# file of its own above it.
node_modules/

# Secrets. The per-app ignores already list these; repeated here because this
# repository is PUBLIC and a single miss is a leaked key.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem

# Per-user Claude Code settings. The `.local` variant is personal by convention
# and can contain permission rules with pasted commands, tokens included.
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# OS noise
.DS_Store

# Competitor teardown screenshots. They contain a real person's name, phone
# number, bank account number and customers' names — not something to publish.
# The written analysis (FINDINGS.md) is kept.
mobile/product-research/*
!mobile/product-research/FINDINGS.md
